From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] propsys: PropVariant vectors, elements and defaults (2038)

propsys: PropVariantGetElementCount and the typed element accessors
(Boolean, Int16/32/64, UInt16/32/64, Double, FileTime, String);
InitPropVariantFrom...Vector for the same types; PropVariantTo...Vector
(into a caller array, TYPE_E_BUFFERTOOSMALL when it does not fit) and
...VectorAlloc (a scalar is a vector of one); the WithDefault conversions;
ClearPropVariantArray. All were stubs. PropVariantToDouble keeps the
fraction of a VT_R8 / VT_R4 and parses decimal strings (it went through a
64-bit integer).
---
